(text "JP3: 2-3 = 5V (default, MSP3525 has a regulator); 1-2 = 3V3.\nR11: GPIO5 is a strapping pin, must be high at boot.  R18 + C9: power-on reset, ~10 ms.\nTFT_eSPI: TFT_RST = -1 (software reset)\nMSP3525 switches its backlight itself (LED pin may be left open); check polarity on arrival." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 187.96 110.49 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "7dd3e31a-0b54-4db9-83c1-06795acb5e9b"))
